{"id":3833,"name":"Kinsou no Vermeil: Gakeppuchi Majutsushi wa Saikyou no Yakusai to Mahou Sekai wo Tsukisusumu","slug":"kinsou_no_vermeil","synopsis":"Royal Ortigia Magic Academy.\r\n\r\nAlto, on the verge of failing the summoning magic class and having to repeat the year, stumbles upon a grimoire and draws a magic circle, summoning the sealed demon Vermeil and making her his familiar. She has been a feared \"devil\" since ancient times and possesses tremendous power to cause disasters.\r\n\r\nVermeil, as a familiar, necessitates magical energy on a daily basis, which she obtains from Alto via passionate kisses. Lilia, Alto's childhood friend, grows envious of their relationship, while the students are also taken aback by the unprecedented familiar. The royal road fantasy of a magician on the edge of failure and an unhealthy devil sister begins!\r\n\r\n(Source: MAL News)","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2022,"createdAt":"2022-07-05 15:31:58","updatedAt":"2022-07-05 15:31:58","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":51213},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":146210},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17245},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":45956},{"site":"ANN","externalId":25419},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":19271},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":9648,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/KBJ2TCKOps2QIietzowIp5vxVeMb4f2jVH9GVaja.jpg"},{"id":9649,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/6ioqQODMfMPbrPgtdtNUCbJwjVouVtGrobv5H7w6.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":372,"name":"Staple Entertainment","slug":"staple_entertainment"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":11610,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":11610,"title":"Abracada-Boo","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":13506,"version":1,"episodes":"1-12","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":15747,"basename":"KinsouNoVermeil-OP1.webm","filen